  "text": "Recipe: Savory Oatmeal Cookies\nCreator: Ajanta Rao\nCategory: Cookies\nIngredients: 1 cup oats (rolled oats or steel cut oats or instant oats), 1 medium apple cut into small pieces, 1 teaspoon cinnamon powder, A pinch of salt (optional), 1/2 teaspoon black pepper, A few pistachios or other nuts or seeds of your choice\nCooking methods: blend, air-fry\nInstructions: Combine all the ingredients together in a bowl. Mix them with a spoon. Then blend them together in a food processor to form a soft mixture.\nMake small balls with the mixture and flatten them into cookie shapes.\nPreheat an air fryer for 3 minutes at 370 F. Air fry the cookies for about 5 minutes until browned. Flip and air fry for about 2 more minutes.",
